DESCRIPTION:Leader: Andrew Kenchington\n\nMeet outside cafe at Victoria par
 k. We will have a good warm up jog\, stretches and drills followed by a ses
 sion focused on improving speed and technique. All on loops on parks altoge
 ther and as much effort/racing as you want. All aiming to improving your ti
 mes over shorter distances! Cool down so all finished by 7pm. Andy K [Phone
  Number Redacted]\n\nView on Strava: https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/gr
 oup_events/3485657744048226462\n\nSynced from Strava Club 208705 on Thu\, 7
  May @ 8:36 AM
